o you  decide how does he decide how does Mike  Tomlin decide how much is too much as  far as how many touches he gets tone  like if if this is the reason why he's  sitting out how do I do that game by  game quarter by quarter  where he doesn't say hey you know too  many touches here or maybe he has  history tangle the way Connor is playing  he doesn't have to worry about getting  sued I'm giving the ball to James Connor  some I'm throwing in the ball and I  don't feel like there's a big drop-off  so hey later on you come back let's win  a Super Bowl I know you're not making  what what you want to make next year I  hope you ring the bell but let's come  back and win this that's what I'd say so  if if I'm Mike Tomlin and if he says you  know what I'm a little with that I'm not  happy but I'm gonna be a good soldier  and let's go win it then I think they  welcome him back but if he's gonna be  there constantly hey I should make more  money I'm not happy I don't know why  they treated me this way then you don't  want that best team in the AFC right now  is I still like Kansas City I know  they've got some defensive weaknesses  Pittsburgh looked great last night they  played real well the last few weeks I  still see the breakdowns though the  Christian McCaffrey wide open nobody  covered them they've got to eliminate  that and Pittsburgh's got an explosive  offense New England's very balanced but  I'll tell you I still like Kansas City I  really do if you were facing Kansas City  with your defensive background what  would you try to do I would say I got to  make you had those 12 14 play drives  I've gotta someway eliminate those big  gassing plays and it's harder to do than  its sound because they've got so many  guys that can make em and Kareem hunt  can take a screen pass 50 yards it looks  like you know you've got a well played  and all of a sudden he's in the end zone  Travis Kelce can you know make a play  and break a tackle and run by people but  that's what that'